<title>ITALY: Italy treasury says won't issue 30-yr BTP in April.</title>
<headline>Italy treasury says won't issue 30-yr BTP in April.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian Treasury said in a statement it would not be offering its new issue 30-year fixed rate bond (BTP) in April.</p>
<p>It said it could not issue the paper for technical reasons. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
